OL,3,ADo you feel guilty when calling in sick
OL,4,Aat work? This might be why...
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou wake up feeling unwell but there's
OL,7,Fa big day at work ahead.
OL,9,FWhat do you do? If the answer is to go
OL,10,Fin (or log on), you're not alone.
OL,12,FResearch suggests anywhere between a
OL,13,Fthird to a half of people in the UK
OL,14,Fwork even when sick - something experts
OL,15,Fcall presenteeism.
OL,17,FAnd your approach to sickness says a
OL,18,Flot about you as an individual and
OL,19,Fwhere you work.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
